      <rule id="DecisionRule_1pvmkcd">
        <description>Collect(SUM) - if Age is 5; 1,2, 3 rules are satified; 20+10+5=35   Collect(MIN) - if Age is 5; 1,2, 3 rules are satified; 20,10,5= 5 Collect(MAX) - if Age is 5; 1,2, 3 rules are satified; 20,10,5= 20 Collect(COUNT) - if Age is 5; 1,2, 3 rules are satified; 20,10,5= 3</description>
